{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Ninja: Underworld \u2013 Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong><u>Exploration</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is a labyrinth, much like an ant nest. Some paths may be inaccessible at first. In such cases, explore thoroughly and search for upgrade items. These items will guide the ninja to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras/47afe270778f2fc882821c3db4ce4d94.avif?t=1758295416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras_big/47afe270778f2fc882821c3db4ce4d94.webp?t=1758295416 width=1560 height=872 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong><u>Combat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ninja wields not only swords and shurikens, but also a variety of attack techniques. Use them wisely to challenge formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras/f23537105d578a997b4ca15c284fcb72.avif?t=1758295416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras_big/f23537105d578a997b4ca15c284fcb72.webp?t=1758295416 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong><u>Upgrades</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating monsters in the underground world grants experience points. Leveling up enhances your abilities. Power up and cut through the hordes of monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras/4f8f40efc1c76832472d21ba3eca9e4e.avif?t=1758295416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras_big/4f8f40efc1c76832472d21ba3eca9e4e.webp?t=1758295416 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 <strong><u>Monsters</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various monsters roam the underground world, seemingly originating from different realms. Defeat the final boss lurking deep within this chaotic domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong><u>Fast Travel</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campfires are scattered throughout the world. You can fast travel between them to explore the underground world more comfortably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras/d1fb2f5a8fff734b154c35ffa106dfb5.avif?t=1758295416\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/extras_big/d1fb2f5a8fff734b154c35ffa106dfb5.webp?t=1758295416 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 <u><strong>Story</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no story\u2014none at all.<br>It\u2019s purely focused on exploration, combat, and upgrades. That\u2019s what it does, and it does it well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Xbox controllers are supported, but some actions\u2014such as settings and fast travel\u2014may require mouse input. Thank you for your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Key configuration is available, but please note that some display elements may not appear correctly. We appreciate your understanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: To ensure a comfortable experience with the full version, we recommend trying the demo first. Please check the system compatibility and gameplay feel before making your purchase.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming Guidelines</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the store page URL in the video description.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include the title \u201cOld Ninja: Underworld\u201d in the video title.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as these conditions are met, you are free to stream or create videos using this game.<br>Monetization is allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated completion time: 1h~2h</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968810?t=1758295416","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3968810?t=1758295416","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/f2c711f11ed0d1645cef49d4db453d2f1857688c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758295416","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3968810/f2c711f11ed0d1645cef49d4db453d2f1857688c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758295416","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4004590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Ninja: Underworld \u2013 Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong><u>Exploration</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is a labyrinth, much like an ant nest. Some paths may be inaccessible at first. In such cases, explore thorough